  (text "0-ohm Resistors\nImprove Sig-Int" (at 88.9 144.78 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 1cb6b314-2e70-4824-b841-21a15eaecab1)
  )
  (text "Power pins\n- VDD3P3 supplies the antenna (and some other things)\n	- CLC needs to be as close to the pin as possible, to suppress harmonics\n	- 10uF and 1uF are needed nearby, to supply burst power\n- VDDA supplies other analog electronics\n- VDD3P3_CPU supplies the CPU and most digital electronics\n	- \n- VDD3P3_RTC supplies the RTC subsytem, and supplies VDD_SPI\n- VDD_SPI is an OUTPUT, and is produced from VDD3P3_RTC\n	- Either 1.8V (via LDO) or 3.3v via 18Ω switch"
    (at 175.26 38.1 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 58e2aa1e-8552-4b42-9644-f6958105126a)
  )
  (text "It is preferred to not\nconnect pins 2 & 4 to\ngnd, so long as the\nlayer below has a\ncontinuous gnd plane\nto shield the crystal."
    (at 20.32 134.62 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 7288d41c-954d-4267-95c1-1f514c2cb7e2)
  )
  (text "Refer to ESP32-S3 Hardware design guidelines:   https://www.espressif.com/sites/default/files/documentation/esp32-s3_hardware_design_guidelines_en.pdf"
    (at 12.7 205.74 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid b8c3d0d6-ba72-4bb2-ba61-95526380684e)
  )
  (text "GPIO45 and GPIO46 are strapping pins" (at 200.66 154.94 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid ca076710-fa25-44b1-be9d-a3abc5565061)
  )
  (text "Replace 40MHz" (at 29.21 114.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid e6f6c302-2204-461d-8ec8-313798934573)
  )

